OL,3,GNEWSAMum of van murder victim welcomes
OL,4,Abollards decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose son was killed by a van
OL,7,Fdriver in Ilkeston town centre has
OL,8,Fwelcomed plans to install permanent
OL,9,Fbollards in the spot where he died.
OL,11,FLoraine Wilson's son Samuel, 26, died
OL,12,Fin December 2023 when Zac Newman drove
OL,13,Fa van into a group in Market Place. He
OL,14,Fwas later convicted of murder.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
