OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMum of van murder victim welcomes
OL,4,Abollards decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilson previously said she had been
OL,7,F"blanked" by Derbyshire County Council
OL,8,Fin her campaign for safety improvements
OL,9,Fbut following a meeting with highways
OL,10,Fbosses, the authority said the
OL,11,Finstallation of bollards in the area
OL,12,Fwas an "important step" to improve
OL,13,Fsafety.
OL,15,F"I'm going to keep on with this, my son
OL,16,Fwas murdered and it shouldn't have
OL,17,Fhappened," she said.
